  ;; ===============================================================
  ;; NOTE: Slots 3-4 (Ports 2-3) and Uplink (Port 4) require
  ;; RTL8367S Units 2-3 to be defined in the symbol library.
  ;; These additional units need pins for:
  ;;   Unit 2: Port 2 (pins 17-24) + Port 3 (pins 25-32) PHY data
  ;;   Unit 3: Port 4 (pins 33-40) uplink PHY data
  ;;   Unit 5: Control (XTL, RESET, LEDs, STRAP, MDC/MDIO)
  ;;   Unit 6: Power (AVDD33, DVDD33, DVDD11, GND pins)
  ;; These will connect Slot 3-4 hierarchical labels and
  ;; the uplink magnetics T1.
  ;; ===============================================================

